This debian/ tree is the official Debian source package: dh-cargo builds
rings from this GitHub source with Debian rustc/cargo and librust-libc-dev,
network-free.

It is not the GitHub Release musl-wrap path in packaging/debian/, which
publishes static .debs to GitHub Releases and the Pages apt repo
(zachwilke.github.io/rings).

The crates.io crate name "rings" is an unrelated icon crate. Do not
package this project via debcargo-from-crates.io.
